# Keep the docker build context small and deterministic: local
# node_modules/target/dist artifacts must never be copied over the
# dependencies installed inside the build stage (their symlinks point
# into the local pnpm store and break the container build).
.git
.github
docs
exports
**/node_modules
**/target
**/dist
**/.vite
**/.vite-temp
playwright-report
test-results
.DS_Store
*.md
CLA.md
LICENSE.txt
